/src/generated/prisma


Create or reset the first ADMIN locally:

```bash
npm run admin:create -- director@example.com "strong-password" "Director Name"
```

Only an authenticated `ADMIN` can open `/{locale}/admin/employees`, create employee invitations, or delete employees. New employees are created without a plaintext password. The ADMIN creates an invitation, shares the generated invite link, and the employee sets their own password on `/{locale}/accept-invite?token=...`.

Deleting an employee removes the `User`; Prisma cascades related `Account`, `Session`, and `EmployeeInvitation` records. Current business tables do not have owner/author/assignee relations to `User`, so there are no business records to transfer or delete with the employee account.
